		'''
		Counts as both melee and magic, and takes the full bonus from each
		Hold left click to pour out a rapid flurry of punches, and keep running while you do
		Every punch lands one hit of area damage around you with very low knockback
		Each punch also scatters a stream of flying flame fists along your cursor
		Targets are set ablaze with Cursed Inferno
		The flurry drains mana as it runs and stops once you run dry
		"Whoever this arm belonged to, the fire has burned that away"
